stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued
    Queued --> Reserved: Take / queue removed, marker written
    Reserved --> Queued: authorized owner return / atomic restore, keep marker
    Reserved --> Refused: Replay / proposed actor guard
    Reserved --> Overlap: Replay / current actor
    Refused --> Executed: successful claim
    Refused --> Lost: race-loss return / abandon reservation and marker
    Overlap --> Queued: race-loss return / durable queued copy survives
    Executed --> [*]
    Lost --> Queued: fresh external receipt after release (not guaranteed)
